      ],
      "content": "SP 80 SE             GREAT AND LITTLE HAMPDEN     LITTLE HAMPDEN 6/50                                              Barn to N. of farmyard                                                   at Manor Farm (formerly 21.6.55                                           listed under Manor Farmhouse                                                   and Barns) GV                                                II Barn, one bay converted to room.  Late C18, of 2 builds.  Timber frame with C20 weatherboard cladding, brick plinth, old tile roof.  7 bays. 2  3-light wooden windows to left, board doors to right of centre and right with 2 barred windows between.  Stone steps to centre door.  3 curved principal trusses with curved braces to tie beams; other trusses with raking queen posts, one with attached ogee braces.  Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP8608203638"
    }
